{%- comment -%}
  Local override of al-folio's _includes/footer.liquid (al_folio_core gem).

  The P1 footer (issue #20): the Partner Strip — Argonne (which leads IDEAS),
  then the six Partners in brand order — above the DOE Office of Science ASCR
  acknowledgment (contract DE-AC02-06CH11357). No contact email is published.
  On phones the one-line strip is too small to read, so the same logos render
  byte for byte from their own files in a grid.

  Partner logos are never recoloured: the strip always sits on white, in both
  modes.

  Tracked with the al-folio overrides audit (ADR-0001):
  bundle exec al-folio upgrade overrides audit
{%- endcomment -%}

<footer class="site-footer" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="container">
    <div
      class="ideas-partner-strip"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Argonne National Laboratory, which leads IDEAS, and the Partners: University of California Davis, University of Cincinnati, University of Illinois Chicago, University of Nebraska–Lincoln, Kitware and Veeda AI."
    >
      <img
        class="ideas-partner-strip-line"
        src="{{ '/assets/img/logos/ideas-partner-strip-large-on-light.svg' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}"
        alt=""
        width="907"
        height="64"
        loading="lazy"
      >
      <ul class="ideas-partner-strip-grid" aria-hidden="true">
        {% assign partner_slugs = 'argonne,ucdavis,cincinnati,uic,unl,kitware,veeda' | split: ',' %}
      {%- for partner in partner_slugs -%}
          <li>
            <img
              src="{{ '/assets/img/logos/partners/' | append: partner | append: '.svg' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="ideas-acknowledgment">
      This material is based upon work supported by the U.S. Department of Energy, Office of Science, Office of Advanced
      Scientific Computing Research (ASCR) under Contract DE-AC02-06CH11357.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
